"P167272528" "Operation Officer Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malta_Nictus_Hunter_Tactical_Ops_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1787366806" "Tac Ops Commanders Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malta_Burn 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// GroupDescription :
"P3589285115" "Malta"
// DisplayNames :
"P638756335" "Flames"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Malta_Tactical_Ops_AlphaStrike_AV 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1050423094" "Director 11, as he is called, would have a dossier of operations and plots several cubic feet large... That is, if he ever left a paper trail. One fact that has managed to get out is his penchant for using excessive amounts of self-propelling proximity mines to control the field of battle."
// DisplayNames :
"P969761275" "Director 11"

