// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Reanimated_Acolyte 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1741202352" "This hollow shell of a Midnighter barely retains a hint of magical aptitude from its former life."
// DisplayNames :
"P998512069" "Reanimated Acolyte"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Reanimated_Acolyte_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Ghoulish_Mystic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P183785113" "More powerful than most of Master Midnight's horde, this aberration retains a number of magical abilities from its life."
// DisplayNames :
"P3549756713" "Ghoulish Mystic"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Ghoulish_Mystic_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Shambling_Archmage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3177378225" "Closer to a Lich than a Zombie, the Shambling Archmage packs a powerful punch with energy magic, and is able to sustain itself off of the life energies of nearby enemies."
// DisplayNames :
"P1961490277" "Shambling Archmage"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Shambling_Archmage_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Master_Midnight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2475131389" "The Midnight Master himself, Master Midnight wrestled control over the Midnight Squad and their Midnight Mansion many moons ago. Those who he has defeated have become slaves to his power, serving him even beyond death as the undead Midnight Masters. Though despite all his power, Master Midnight lacks true knowledge of magic, a gap he is working feverishly to close in the hopes of obtaining the affections of Diabolique."
// DisplayNames :
"P1768114360" "Master Midnight"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Master_Midnight_NoHelmet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Master_Midnight_Spirit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2210874009" "Following his sacrificial act which saved Diabolique from Sorceress Serene's ritual, young Percy Winkley's soul was sent to the Netherworld, but ended up trapped between worlds in the Night Ward. Now he is awaiting processing by the Drudges, but like the other souls here in Night Ward, he is trapped until whatever power is pulling worlds together is stopped."
// DisplayNames :
"P2902134618" "Soul of Percy Winkley"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Master_Midnight_Reanimated_Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P485324467" "Master Midnight's suit of armor was infused with numerous magical spells, giving him tremendous protection. That magic, however, appears to have gained an intellect of its own following Midnight's demise and has begun carrying out its own plans; sans Master Midnight's body."
// DisplayNames :
"P1087925798" "Master Midnight's Mail of Magical Mastery"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Master_Midnight_Resurrected 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2321771315" "Recombining his soul with his physical remains and armor has reconstituted young Percy Winkley and returned him to a semblance of life, not unlike the rest of the Midnight Masters. Whether he uses his powers for good or ill, however, remains to be seen."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - MidnightMasters_Montague_Castanella 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2161904706" "Freed from the magic that enslaved him to Master Midnight, Montague Castanella is once again the leader of the Midnight Squad."
// DisplayNames :

