// DisplayDescription :
"P719158336" "Nexus 99 is a scientist who development a method of tapping into an alternate dimension power source and using it as a weapon. He's been imprisoned in the Zigursky prison on grand theft charges."
// DisplayNames :
"P1186906311" "Nexus 99"

