// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nemesis_Nemesis_Soldier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P388409163" "Although Nemesis likes to dress his soldiers in 19th century style, their weaponry is decidedly modern. Most infantrymen attach their bayonets to special assault rifles that outperform all modern equivalents."
// DisplayNames :
"P3697722655" "Chasseur"
// DisplayNames :
"P4117714011" "Armiger"
// DisplayNames :
"P1524846578" "Lancer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nemesis_Nemesis_Medic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P617789741" "The Battle Surgeons are charged with the vital duty of getting wounded soldiers back into the fight as quickly as possible. Most Nemesis officers frown upon those who refuse to fight again; courage in the face of danger is highly valued in the Nemesis army ranks."
// DisplayNames :
"P2428324006" "Chasseur surgeon"
// DisplayNames :
"P2668356996" "Armiger surgeon"
// DisplayNames :
"P3570732531" "Lancer surgeon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nemesis_Nemesis_Support 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3707283974" "The Nemesis army's main support weapon is the storm rifle, a long barreled weapon with a bayonet affixed to the end. It fires compact shells that carry a tremendous punch, exploding with the force of a heavy grenade or rocket shell."
// DisplayNames :
"P1348756198" "Carabineir"
// DisplayNames :
"P3177428538" "Fusilier"
// DisplayNames :
"P2825822225" "Grenadier"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nemesis_Nemesis_Sniper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P520149370" "At first glance, the Nemesis lance looks much like the spear from which it takes its name. Though it can be used as a spear, it's also a very powerful, accurate rifle. The Nemesis lance fires explosive rounds over long distances and requires great skill to use effectively."
// DisplayNames :
"P3095442629" "Lance Corporal Comet"
// DisplayNames :
"P160491803" "Subaltern Comet"
// DisplayNames :
"P1904835834" "Lance Sgt Comet"
// DisplayNames :
