// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstalkers_Shadow_Wolf 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2030602403" "The Spirit Stalkers are the souls of predators bound to the twisted will of the Shadow Hunter, the embodiment of Nature's primal need for life to feed on life. This spirit remnant was once a living animal, but in death its soul is now bound to Shadow Hunter's will, roaming the wilds of Night Ward on a never ending hunt."
// DisplayNames :
"P712532610" "Shadow Hound"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstalkers_Shadow_Wolf_Summoned 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstalkers_Houndmaster 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P405270309" "The Spirit Stalkers are the souls of predators bound to the twisted will of Shadow Hunter, the embodiment of Nature's primal need for life to feed on life. While other creatures are ruled by the laws of Nature, mankind has ever sought to dominate it instead. Shadow Hunter has harnessed this instinct and molded the ruthless will of man into his deadly Huntmasters. No creature is beyond their cruel ambition to hunt down and make into a trophy to display their dominance."
// DisplayNames :
"P2506026364" "Huntmaster"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstalkers_Spirit_Panther 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P961618123" "The Spirit Stalkers are the souls of predators bound to the twisted will of Shadow Hunter, the embodiment of Nature's primal need for life to feed on life. Native to the Netherworld, Spirit Panthers have long been idolized by spirit seers as a symbol of secrets and guile. Twisted by Shadow Hunter’s will they now stalk the places between worlds feeding on the dreams, emotions, and vital energy of spirits that have been trapped in Night Ward."
// DisplayNames :
"P2554091358" "Spirit Panther"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstalkers_Wodan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2204238429" "The Spirit Stalkers are the souls of predators bound to the twisted will of Shadow Hunter, the embodiment of Nature's primal need for life to feed on life. Monstrous beasts that embody the fury of the hunt, Wodans are the dominant alpha wolves of Shadow Hunter's pack. Their ferocity is unmatched in the spirit realm, and they have a preternatural ability to drive their pack into feeding frenzies."
// DisplayNames :
"P3060168406" "Wodan"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Nightstalkers_Wodan_Summoned 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

