// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Low_Knife_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P138130122" "Unlike the higher ranked members of the Outcasts, these thugs seldom have elemental powers strong enough to warm their morning coffee. They're limited to hand weapons and firearms, like any other common gangster."
// DisplayNames :
"P1108956327" "Outcast Initiate Slicer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Low_Bat_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P143420846" "Outcast Initiate Slugger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Low_Sledgehammer_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4291180894" "Outcast Initiate Slammer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Low_Axe_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P171239046" "Outcast Initiate Chopper"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Low_Air_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3181970529" "Outcast Initiates who show potential are valuable commodities amongst the Outcasts, and are quickly elevated up the ranks. Volts have shown promise in manipulating and controlling their Electrical powers."
// DisplayNames :
"P311005937" "Volt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Low_Fire_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1071448940" "Outcast Initiates who show potential are valuable commodities amongst the Outcasts, and are quickly elevated up the ranks. An Outcast Match has started to demonstrate his fire starting abilities."
// DisplayNames :
"P3147491841" "Match"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Low_Ice_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2398404062" "Outcast Initiates who show potential are valuable commodities amongst the Outcasts, and are quickly elevated up the ranks. Chillers have grown beyond the ability to keep a drink cool."
// DisplayNames :
"P246865308" "Chiller"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Low_Stone_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3059151237" "Outcast Initiates who show potential are valuable commodities amongst the Outcasts, and are quickly elevated up the ranks. Blocks are just learning how to harden their bodies into stone, and control the primal forces of earth and rock."
// DisplayNames :
"P1121630246" "Block"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Brawl_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P997598001" "Unlike the higher ranked members of the Outcasts, these thug's elemental powers are only beginning to manifest.  Never-the-less, they are much more power than your typical thug."
// DisplayNames :
"P1090846624" "Outcast Crusher"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Bat_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2302430192" "Outcast Cooler"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Sledgehammer_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3318337351" "Outcast Charger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_SubmachineGun_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3743251214" "Outcast Torch"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Air_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1779311291" "Masters of the air, the Shockers can fly and call forth blasts of lightning. They are without a doubt the flashiest of the Outcasts, and enjoy flamboyant displays of their power."
// DisplayNames :
"P3137647137" "Shocker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Air_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P332344068" "Experienced Shockers are masters of their chosen element. They soar with the expertise of veteran flyers and can make electricity dance at their commands. They're especially fond of entrapping their rivals in fields of lightning."
// DisplayNames :
"P2408298123" "Lead Shocker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Fire_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2630043332" "Rivals to the title of the city's premiere arsonists, these Outcasts can conjure up a variety of flame-based attacks to scorch their enemies. Manipulating fire requires concentration and determination, two traits common in all Scorchers."
// DisplayNames :
"P3081977491" "Scorcher"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Fire_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2248078076" "These are the pinnacle pyros of the Outcasts, masters of the element of fire. They can perform a myriad of fiery marvels, one of the flashiest of which is the creation of Fire Imps: malevolent humanoids of pure fire who pounce upon the Scorchers' foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P2172975969" "Lead Scorcher"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Ice_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2038722902" "Not just an appliance anymore, the Freezers have mastery over cold and ice. As their name suggests, they're cool as ice and calm under pressure, even as they cast bolts of jagged ice that pierce flesh and bone alike."
// DisplayNames :
"P1586540175" "Freezer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Ice_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3644800472" "The top-dog Freezers are constantly surrounded by an area of cold, even on the hottest summer's day. They can create a host of different cold-based effects, from frost armor for themselves to freezing prisons for their foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P1780460069" "Lead Freezer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Stone_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1449024757" "The Bricks are one with the Earth, although not in a hippie kind of way. Instead they use stone and rock to smash their rivals, hurling boulders or conjuring up mallets with which to maul anyone who gets in their way."
// DisplayNames :
"P4136756280" "Brick"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Stone_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2048405783" "The biggest, baddest, Bricks on the block have complete control over the earth beneath their feet. They can turn soil into quicksand, cause stalagmites to erupt at the snap of a finger and generally make life miserable for anyone they don't like who happens to be standing on the ground."
// DisplayNames :
"P627021171" "Lead Brick"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Frostfire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1931729141" "Leonard Calhoun used to imagine life as a hero. His strong elemental powers seemed to be just what the job required. Leonard made himself a costume and took up the name Frostfire, but he soon found that saving people wasn't nearly as appealing as picking their pockets. Frostfire descended into a life of crime and began to gather together other misguided mutants such as himself. Thus, the Outcasts were born."
// DisplayNames :
"P2152105039" "FrostFire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Greased_Lightning 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Nictus_Hunter_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2681346589" "Outcast Quantum Gunner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Nictus_Hunter_Air_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P701891918" "Quantum Volt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Nictus_Hunter_Ice_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P90190898" "Quantum Chiller"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Nictus_Hunter_Fire_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2460204989" "Lead Quantum Scorcher"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Outcasts_Nictus_Hunter_Stone_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1982556891" "Lead Quantum Brick"

