// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - ParagonPolice_PPD_Psi-Cop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3272307451" "It isn't always physical strength or force that triumphs in the end. By honing their minds in intensive training programs, these officers have unlocked their psionic potential, using their minds to affect the world around them. With manipulative mind control and potent telekinesis abilities they can halt even the most determined law breakers."
// DisplayNames :
"P2021661463" "PPD Psi-Cop"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - ParagonPolice_PPD_Mindslayer 
