// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Peacebringers_Sunstorm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2006651253" "When the Kheldian warrior called Perihelion arrived on Earth, it sought a human warrior with courage and strength to match it's own as a host.  Sgt. Benjamin Carter was a Paragon Police Department officer who was facing down a Vahzilok menace, and Perihelion saw this as the opportunity to bond with him and form a powerful Kheldian Peacebringer. They became the being called Sunstorm, and handily defeated the surrounding Vahzilok.  While he has no real rank over the rest of his kind, Sunstorm usually coordinates the activities of his fellow Peacebringers on Earth, mainly due to his great experience and wisdom."
// DisplayNames :
"P93035954" "Sunstorm"

