// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PossessedApparitions_Suspicious_Citizen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P548462052" "There's something subtly wrong with this citizen, you can't quite put your finger on it."
// GroupDescription :
"P3776727539" "Possessed"
// DisplayNames :
"P1166283040" "Suspicious Citizen"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PossessedApparitions_Ego 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P191643568" "These furious vortices of psychic energy are all that remain after a psyche is shattered and stripped away from their body. Egos wander the world aimlessly lashing out at those that still possess a mortal shell."
// GroupDescription :
"P157489679" "Apparitions"
// DisplayNames :
"P2124486544" "Ego"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PossessedApparitions_Enraged_Ego 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2236962286" "While these discarded psyches try to cling to their individuality, when threatened they may latch onto another forming a much more powerful Enraged Ego. Enraged Egos prefer to tear apart the minds of those that have earned their ire with powerful tendril-like extensions of their will."
// DisplayNames :
"P2599036743" "Enraged Ego"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PossessedApparitions_Peculiar_Citizen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3176909732" "There's definitely something wrong with this citizen, just being near them causes your head to swim."
// DisplayNames :
"P3866723208" "Peculiar Citizen"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PossessedApparitions_Id 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P308150678" "Ids exist in a constant state of agony and fear. They can only barely remember what they were before their psyche was sundered, all they can remember is the pain caused by what caused them to be split."
// DisplayNames :
"P717046770" "Id"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PossessedApparitions_Enraged_Id 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P5844720" "While these discarded psyches try to cling to their individuality, when threatened they may latch onto another forming a much more powerful Enraged Id. Enraged Ids are entities of pure aggression and fury, they seek to destroy the minds of those who have earned their enmity."
// DisplayNames :
"P1866637182" "Enraged Id"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PossessedApparitions_Possessed_Citizen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2698728701" "This citizen is clearly being controlled against their will by some external, or maybe even some internal influence."
// DisplayNames :
"P2785100664" "Possessed Citizen"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PossessedApparitions_Psyche 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2749318404" "Psyches retained just enough of their sanity to be very, very angry. Unfortunately they don't remember who to blame so they take it out on anyone who crosses their path."
// DisplayNames :
"P3479493980" "Psyche"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PossessedApparitions_Enraged_Psyche 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2045399270" "Enraged Psyche"

