// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianCitizensFirstWard_Katie_Douglas 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3863664709" "Katie Douglas is an ex-seer who escaped from the Seer Network and the authorities and made her way to First Ward. She has worked tirelessly toward freeing other Seers and has enjoyed limited success in the First Ward. To accomplish that feat, however, she has had to lie low and choose her allies very carefully. The Resistance sees her as nothing more than a weapon; politically or literally, and the Loyalists would just as soon place her back into the Network for another 15 years."
// DisplayNames :
"P1078912095" "Katie Douglas"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianCitizensFirstWard_Anna_Palatine_Citizen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3548392680" "The appointed sovereign of the Survivor Compound in First Ward, Anna Palatine's title has been ignored by the Hetman, except for when it has suited his aims."
// DisplayNames :
"P3590639800" "Anna Palatine"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianCitizensFirstWard_Blind_Makwa 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1038965489" "Blind Makwa was born without sight like normal men. He was gifted with the rare and beautiful ability to see spirits as others see one another every day. It was this reason that he became a well respected medicine man. His ability to converse with those who had taken the heaven's road and joined with the great spirit was sought by many in the wake of the Hamidon Wars. But dead men are supposed to tell no tales, and so when Blind Makwa began hearing terrible truths, he snuck away to the First Ward where he would be safe, and no one would look for him."
// DisplayNames :
"P1581026090" "Blind Makwa"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianCitizensFirstWard_Katie_Douglas_Posessed 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

