// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkAntiMatter_Android_Cleaner 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2110855797" "Cleaners are designed for simple labor intensive tasks like cleaning, welding, and repairing other Clockwork. They have an innocuous appearance, however if threatened they are more than capable of defending themselves."
// DisplayNames :
"P1450804165" "Scrub Bot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkAntiMatter_Android_Sweeper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P329770836" "Sweepers are often seen patrolling the street cleaning up litter and debris to make Praetoria a more beautiful place to live. They have an innocuous appearance, however if threatened they are more than capable of defending themselves."
// DisplayNames :
"P2696955929" "Vacuum Bot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkAntiMatter_Android_Mender 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2583662328" "Menders are often seen repairing broken structures and machines, including other Androids. Their top priority is to keep the other Androids in tip-top working condition."
// DisplayNames :
"P63370697" "Repair Bot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkAntiMatter_Android_Builder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2615994109" "Should another Clockwork Android fall due to unforeseen circumstances or job hazards the Builders are there to rebuild the fallen Android on the job."
// DisplayNames :
"P2305369029" "Fabricator Bot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkAntiMatter_Android_Dismantler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P214233924" "Dismantlers are occasionally called in when their plasma torches can be put to use to tear apart crumbling or collapsed buildings. These behemoth Androids are the heavy lifters, movers and builders of the Android labor units."
// DisplayNames :
"P3029683929" "Wrecker Bot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkAntiMatter_Android_Lifter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P857786330" "Lifters, as their name indicates, do a lot of the heavy lifting and construction. They are able to easily lift machinery and building materials that previously could only be lifted by powerful cranes. These behemoth Androids are the heavy lifters, movers and builders of the Android labor units."
// DisplayNames :
"P810752571" "Hauler Bot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkAntiMatter_SentryTurret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P390500130" "Sentry Turret are immobile turrets that ensure the security of sensitive areas. They never leave their post and their plasma gun can reach out and touch anyone even remotely threatening their position."
// DisplayNames :
"P733879613" "Sentry Turret"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkAntiMatter_SentryTurret_Mobile 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2270512726" "Sentry Turret are mobile turrets that ensure the security of sensitive areas."
// DisplayNames :
"P1381484420" "Mobile Sentry Turret"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkAntiMatter_GuardianTurret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2331099392" "Guardian Turrets are immobile turrets that ensure the security of sensitive areas. They never leave their post and their plasma cannon can reach out and touch anyone even remotely threatening their position."
// DisplayNames :
"P4634970" "Guardian Turret"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkAntiMatter_GuardianTurret_Mobile 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P565091424" "Guardian Turrets are mobile turrets that ensure the security of sensitive areas."
// DisplayNames :
"P1397223048" "Mobile Guardian Turret"

