// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_Android_Cleaner 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3162460868" "Cleaners are designed for simple labor intensive tasks like cleaning, welding, repairing other clockwork. They have an innocuous appearance, however if threatened they are more than capable of defending themselves.  These Clockwork androids appear to be malfunctioning."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_Android_Sweeper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P234805967" "Sweepers are often seen patrolling the street cleaning up litter and debris to make Praetoria a more beautiful place to live. They have an innocuous appearance, however if threatened they are more than capable of defending themselves.  These Clockwork androids appear to be malfunctioning."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_Android_Mender 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P567119819" "Menders are often seen repairing broken structures and machines, including other androids. Their top priority is to keep the other Androids in tip-top working condition.  These Clockwork androids appear to be malfunctioning."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_Android_Builder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2708851500" "Should another Clockwork Android fall due to unforeseen circumstances or job hazards the Builders are there to rebuild the fallen Android on the job.  These Clockwork androids appear to be malfunctioning."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_AntimatterRayBurn 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_Android_Dismantler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2281179753" "Dismantlers are occasionally called in when their plasma torches can be put to use to tear apart crumbling or collapsed buildings. These Behemoth Androids are the heavy lifters, movers and builders of the android labor units.  These Clockwork androids appear to be malfunctioning."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_Android_Lifter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3952008198" "Lifters, as their name indicates, do a lot of the heavy lifting and construction. They are able to easily lift machinery and building materials that previously could only be lifted by powerful cranes. These Behemoth Androids are the heavy lifters, movers and builders of the android labor units.  These Clockwork androids appear to be malfunctioning."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_SentryTurret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_SentryTurret_Mobile 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_GuardianTurret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_GuardianTurret_Mobile 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_Metronome_MkI 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P505051538" "This monstrous construct is being pieced together from numerous stock and customized clockwork parts. It appears to be quite a different machine than any clockwork you've ever seen."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_Metronome_MkII 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4275739255" "This monstrosity is a physical manifestation of the malignant clockwork virus known as Metronome. It incorporates various parts from existing clockwork, but hints of a brilliant design greater than the parts are clearly evident."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianClockworkRogue_Metronome_MkIII 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1838324767" "This monstrosity is a physical manifestation of the malignant clockwork virus known as Metronome. It incorporates various parts from existing clockwork, including powerful integral weaponry, but hints of a brilliant design greater than the parts are clearly evident."
// DisplayNames :

