"P4254735291" "Sibyls are specially trained Diviners with the ability to detect nearly anything around them, no matter how well hidden. They are mid-rank combatants among the elite. They specialize in crushing their foes in close range combat."
// DisplayNames :
"P236259853" "Sibyl"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianIDFEndgame_Seer_TPN_Telepathist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1471988216" "Telepathists are unique amongst the Seers, in that they have focused all of their psychic power in being able to influence the minds of Praetorian citizens. They have no ability to defend themselves except by changing otherwise peaceful citizens into fierce combatants in defense of Praetoria."
// DisplayNames :
"P2131687065" "Telepathist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianIDFEndgame_TPN_Technician 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
