// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Recruit_Tutorial 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1453520894" "Resistance Recruits are largely untrained, fresh-faced recruits in the Resistance fighting force. They are equipped with outdated military firearms that have been hastily upgraded with power packs and other accessories to give them a heavy enough punch to threaten the PPD."
// DisplayNames :
"P2042015429" "Resistance Recruit"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Recruit_Tutorial_End 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Recruit_Tutorial_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Recruit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Recruit_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Fighter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P157571008" "Resistance Fighters are experienced resistance recruits who have learned by doing rather than training. They are equipped with outdated military firearms that have been hastily upgraded with power packs and other accessories to give them a heavy enough punch to threaten the PPD."
// DisplayNames :
"P332744534" "Resistance Fighter"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Fighter_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Veteran 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P732565272" "Resistance Veterans are surviving soldiers from the last wars before Cole's world order took over. They are well trained, disciplined, elite fighters armed with some of the best modified weapons the resistance can slap together."
// DisplayNames :
"P2718157717" "Resistance Veteran"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Veteran_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Commando 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2177667682" "Resistance Commandos are surviving soldiers from the last wars before Cole's world order took over. They are well trained, disciplined, elite fighters armed with some of the best modified weapons the resistance can slap together."
// DisplayNames :
"P3092633617" "Resistance Commando"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Commando_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Heavy_Barrel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P351581507" "Resistance Heavy Barrels are walking mobile guns. Their exo-skeleton provides them with the strength to carry such high-powered weapons, and the addition of welded on steel plating enables them to withstand just about any return fire."
// DisplayNames :
"P4043031329" "Resistance Heavy Barrel"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Heavy_Hands 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1831829437" "Resistance Heavy Hands are walking wrecking crews. Their exo-skeleton provides them with the strength to fight with their massive clockwork construction arms, and the addition of welded on steel plating enables them to withstand just about any fire on their way into melee, and any punishment their foes can dish out."
// DisplayNames :
"P1291474921" "Resistance Heavy Hands"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Officer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4200994262" "Officers are veteran soldiers who have years of command experience. They use their leadership skills to hone the resistance fighters under their command into a deadly fighting force whether they are raw recruits, or elite commandos. They also pack the best weapons they can get their hands on."
// DisplayNames :
"P3954068336" "Resistance Officer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Officer_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Calvin_Scott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P195817985" "Calvin Scott is a high ranking member of the Resistance, a small force determined to remove Emperor Cole from power no matter the cost."
// DisplayClassName :
"P782614084" "Resistance Leader"
// DisplayNames :
"P4278277396" "Calvin Scott"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Vanessa_DeVore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1712597565" "Vanessa DeVore is the mother of the resistance. It was her warning of what was to come in Cole's new world order that unified a small group of important military leaders into what would one day become the Resistance. Without DeVore's immense psychic power the Resistance would have been tracked down by Mother Mayhem's Seers, and smashed by the PPD."
// GroupDescription :
"P2837443416" "Carnival of Light"
// DisplayNames :
"P1920779758" "Vanessa DeVore"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Vanessa_DeVore_Clone 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Belladonna_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4151204414" "One of the deadliest covert agents in the world, Belladonna has proven herself a most capable spy and killer for the Resistance. Though her past is a well kept secret, Belladonna makes it clear that she has no love for Tyrant or his lackeys. Rumors abound that she was trained by Chimera; Tyrant's Praetor of Intelligence and widely considered the deadliest assassin in the world. Belladonna will one day put that title to the test."
// DisplayClassName :
"P1165603828" "Assassin"
// DisplayNames :
"P2250471757" "Belladonna Vetrano"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Belladonna 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Jack_Hammer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1421428368" "Jack Hammer is a veteran of the Resistance, willing to do whatever it takes to get the job done. This includes injecting himself with just the right amount of Fixodyne to keep himself sane during the job, but powerful enough to stand toe to toe with members of the Powers Division."
// DisplayClassName :
"P2730537388" "Cell Leader"
// DisplayNames :
"P772573562" "Jack Hammer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Vagabond 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3518315645" "Vagabond is a man who has stared into the face of death and laughed at it. He is regarded highly in the Resistance and is willing to do whatever it takes to bring down Cole and his regime."
// DisplayClassName :
"P73627299" "Veteran"
// DisplayNames :
"P151802779" "Vagabond"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Hatchet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P822672416" "Hatchet is known in the Resistance for his 'pet' ghoul, a monster that he trained on his own. Many fear ever having to fight Hatchet, knowing that he is not one to show any mercy."
// DisplayClassName :
"P3532858830" "Ghoul Tamer"
// DisplayNames :
"P96966178" "Hatchet"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Wardog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3545579062" "Wardog's name strikes fear into the hearts of even the most brave Loyalist. His thirst for vengeance against Cole rivals that of Calvin Scott. Some say that he spends every waking moment thinking about the day when he'll get a chance to personally put an end to Cole."
// DisplayNames :
"P3141554025" "Wardog"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Ricochet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2151100378" "From her broad smile and the splash of crazy in her eyes, to her dizzying speech pattern and signature pink PPD helmet, everything about Ricochet is memorable. She earned her name like most of the others do in the Crusaders: by how she got her first kill. In Ricochet's case, rumor has it, she let off a blind shot during her first engagement which ricocheted off of a PPD power field and ruptured a high pressure fuel tank. The resulting explosion took out the entire PPD squad, saving the lives of her comrades.<br><br>The other story is that the bullet ricocheted into her head."
// DisplayNames :
"P3652736830" "Ricochet"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Dr_Steffard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P18940996" "Dr. Steffard is secretly the Seer murdering villain known to Praetoria as "Cutter Cain". His true motive is to rehabilitate the Seers and give them back their lives, but the process doesn't always result in success."
// DisplayNames :
"P2966469622" "Dr. Steffard"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Tunnel_Rat 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3182972429" "Tunnel Rat may look meek and skittish... Ok, yeah, she's pretty skittish, but this little mouse has the heart of a lion!"
// DisplayNames :
"P399962985" "Tunnel Rat"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Beholder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4139847206" "Beholder is a rare sight; a former seer who has broken completely from Praetor Tilman's network. She is infamous for the amount of chaos and destruction she has caused within Imperial City."
// DisplayClassName :
"P2410521981" "Former Seer"
// DisplayNames :
"P2961092773" "Beholder"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_BasiliskBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1172306039" "These trained killers were once part of Project Phoenix, following every order given to them by Praetor Sinclair. They now seek freedom from Sinclair at any cost."
// GroupDescription :
"P1833469820" "Praetorians"
// DisplayNames :
"P3528137994" "Basilisk"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_GorgonBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2084369774" "Gorgon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_PhoenixBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3844903833" "Phoenix"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_CockatriceBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4174023196" "Cockatrice"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Crow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2733800730" "Crow is the only surviving member of an elite military unit that was subjected to one of Neuron's experiments. Though he does not excuse Neuron of his carelessness, it is his commander, Colonel Duray, that is the focus of his vengeace."
// DisplayNames :
"P3549693702" "Crow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Ghoul_Rehab_Soldier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P338205713" "This Ghoul has been rehabilitated by Dr. Helix.  Each one was a former member of an elite military unit subjected to Neuron's horrible experimentation."
// DisplayNames :
"P107934584" "Dog of War"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Helix 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3304059700" "Dr. Helix is a brilliant geneticist who is working with the Resistance. A one time associate of Dr. Hetzfeld's, she left the mad doctor's employ when he abandoned her in the tunnels during one of her observation forays. A chance meeting with Crow saved her from certain death at the hands of the Ghouls, and lead to her joining up with the Resistance. Her special environmental suit allows her to turn completely undetectable, making her a valuable asset for reconnaissance and covert operations."
// DisplayNames :
"P158726144" "Helix"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Fighter_PrimalMission_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3938348871" "Elite Resistance Fighter"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Fighter_PrimalMission_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Commando_PrimalMission_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3525088203" "Elite Resistance Commando"

