// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Runesoldier_PrimalMission_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2928111664" "Runesoldiers are high ranking members of the Resistance who have served under the tutelage of a master within the Carnival of Light. Through this training, they have adapted their high-tech weaponry to serve as a focus for mystic energies. However, their mastery of the knowledge they have received is less than ideal, causing their magical energy attacks to have a small element of randomness in the type of energy they produce."
// DisplayNames :
"P2762073458" "Elite Resistance Runesoldier"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianResistance_Runesoldier_PrimalMission_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

